re display\n- **No \"PTS\" label** found in any component files\n\n### Documentation References\nFound the specification for the score display in documentation:\n\n**`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/specs/scoring-system.md` (line 64):**\n```\n- **Location**: Top-left of screen\n- **Format**: Large number with \"PTS\" label\n- **Animation**: \n  - Smooth increment when score changes\n  - Brief pulse/flash on point gain\n  - Color: White/bright, stands out from grid\n```\n\n**`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` (line 429):**\n```\n- [ ] Implement score display\n  - Top-left of screen with \"PTS\" label\n  - Smooth increment animation (lerp 0.2s)\n  - Brief pulse/flash on point gain\n  - Milestone flash every 100 points\n```\n\n### Summary\n- ✅ **Scoring logic**: Fully implemented in `src/lib/scoring.ts`\n- ❌ **Score display UI**: Not yet implemented\n- ❌ **\"PTS\" label**: Does not exist in any component\n\nThe score display with \"PTS\" label is marked as incomplete in the implementation plan and needs to be added as a UI component.\n</task_result>","title":"Find score display component","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39d840dedffeqUO67QFr6M2Xvh","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771178816016,"end":1771178947736}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1771178951730,"sessionID":"ses_39d873d0fffe1FxcQovLtdjhwD","part":{"id":"prt_c627bf1f50014aiQu4P7Zq2mpI","sessionID":"ses_39d873d0fffe1FxcQovLtdjhwD","messageID":"msg_c627bbe37001ESPebeaUX6rVUI","type":"tool","callID":"call_553b5f286924497183fd7dff","tool":"task","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Find GlassHUD implementation","prompt":"Search for GlassHUD component or any similar HUD overlay components in the codebase. Look for files in src/components/ that might contain UI controls, HUD, or glass effect components. Also search for any mentions of \"HUD\", \"glass\", \"overlay\", or similar UI container components.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"task_id: ses_39d840e06ffeN4hn8hLmQCfxb4 (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\n## Search Results Summary\n\nI've found all the HUD and glass-effect UI components in the codebase. Here's a complete breakdown:\n\n---\n\n### **Primary HUD Component: GlassHUD**\n\n**Location:** `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/GlassHUD.tsx`\n\n**Purpose:** A comprehensive HUD (Heads-Up Display) overlay for the Game of Life application with a glassmorphism effect.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- **Glass Effect Style:** Uses `backdrop-filter: blur(10px)`, semi-transparent backgrounds, and subtle borders\n- **Control Groups:**\n  - Start/Running button\n  - Random and Clear buttons (with danger styling for Clear)\n  - Draw/Erase mode toggle\n  - Grid preset selection (Small/Medium/Large)\n  - Grid visibility toggle\n  - Settings button\n- **Status Display:**\n  - Phase indicator (PLANNING/COUNTDOWN/RUNNING)\n  - Alive cell count\n  - Flux metric with color-coded values (green/orange/red)\n\n**Props:**\n```typescript\n- phase: GamePhase\n- aliveCount: number\n- flux: number, fluxMax: number\n- interactionMode: InteractionMode\n- gridPreset: GridSizePreset\n- showGridLines: boolean\n- canStart: boolean, canInteract: boolean\n- onStart, onClear, onRandom, onToggleGrid\n- onSetMode, onSetGridPreset, onToggleSettings\n```\n\n**Styles:** `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/styles/GlassHUD.css`\n- Fixed positioning at bottom center\n- Responsive design with mobile breakpoints\n- Hover effects with cyan accent colors\n- Disabled state styling\n\n---\n\n### **Secondary Components**\n\n#### 1. **IntroOverlay**\n**Location:** `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/IntroOverlay.tsx`\n\n**Purpose:** A full-screen introductory overlay with glitch text effect animations.\n\n**Features:**\n- Glitch animation on title using CSS keyframes\n- Fade-out transition when entering the game\n- Dark background with high contrast\n- Entrance button with hover shimmer effect\n\n**Styles:** `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/styles/IntroOverlay.css`\n- Custom glitch animations\n- Scale and fade transitions\n- Gradient hover effects on buttons\n\n#### 2. **UIToggleButton**\n**Location:** `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/UIToggleButton.tsx`\n\n**Purpose:** A toggle button to show/hide the UI with eye icons.\n\n**Features:**\n- Fixed positioning at top-right corner\n- SVG eye icons (open/closed)\n- Glass effect styling\n- Accessible labels\n\n**Styles:** Included in GlassHUD.css\n\n---\n\n### **Usage Context**\n\nThe **Game** component (`/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/Game.tsx`) currently implements its own inline UI controls without using the GlassHUD component. However, GlassHUD appears to be a more polished, componentized version of the same functionality with glassmorphism styling.\n\n---\n\n### **CSS Classes Overview**\n\n**GlassHUD.css contains:**\n- `.glass-hud` - Main glass effect container\n- `.glass-hud-container` - Fixed positioning wrapper\n- `.hud-button` - Button styling with variants (active, danger, disabled)\n- `.hud-group` - Button grouping\n- `.hud-status` - Status display panel\n- `.ui-toggle-button` - Visibility toggle button\n\n**IntroOverlay.css contains:**\n- `.intro-overlay` - Full-screen overlay\n- `.intro-title` - Title with glitch effect\n- `.enter-button` - Entrance button with animations\n- Custom keyframe animations for glitch and fade effects\n\n---\n\n### **Component Hierarchy**\n```\nApp.tsx\n└── Game.tsx (current - uses inline UI)\n    ├── GridInteraction.tsx\n    └── CanvasGrid.tsx\n\nGlassHUD.tsx (standalone - not currently integrated)\nUIToggleButton.tsx (standalone)\nIntroOverlay.tsx (standalone)\n```\n\nAll three components have corresponding test files (`.test.tsx`) indicating they are well-tested and production-ready components.\n</task_result>","title":"Find GlassHUD implementation","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39d840e06ffeN4hn8hLmQCfxb4","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771178815992,"end":1771178951728}}}}
